      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on pleural fluid be used to diagnose pleural TB in adults and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        83.61033630371094,
        449.237060546875,
        97.69833374023438
      ],
      "text": "adolescents with signs and symptoms of pleural TB, against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.36524200439453,
        526.6203002929688,
        121.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT summary sensitivity and specificity were 74.0% (95% CI: 60.8–83.9) and 88.1%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        123.86524200439453,
        526.9616088867188,
        137.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 78.8–93.6), respectively, from 13 Xpert Ultra studies (1041 participants) ( ).  Fig. 2.1.6",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.365234375,
        526.964599609375,
        152.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "The certainty of evidence was low for sensitivity and very low for specificity. Only one study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        154.865234375,
        526.7882690429688,
        168.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "(Jose 2024) provided accuracy estimates for pleural fluid for Truenat MTB Plus (88 participants),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970008850097656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.365234375,
        527.2700805664062,
        183.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "with sensitivity of 100% (95% CI: 0.03–100) and specificity of 100% (95% CI: 0.95–100). Similar",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973567962646484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.865234375,
        526.9622192382812,
        199.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "to lymph node fluid and pleural tissue, the data using the CRS were also considered for this",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.365234375,
        526.9656982421875,
        214.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "sample type. The use of the CRS increased specificity of LC-aNAATs on pleural fluid to 99.2%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.865234375,
        527.1594848632812,
        230.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 95.2%–99.9%) but decreased sensitivity to 71.3% (95% CI: 64.3%–77.4%) (see  Web",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.365234375,
        526.9796752929688,
        245.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "). Only data on Xpert Ultra were included in the evaluation to answer this PICO  Annex B.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.865234375,
        265.9153747558594,
        261.01025390625
      ],
      "text": "question. Data on Truenat were limited.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
