        526.50048828125,
        571.8073120117188
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; FN: false negative; FP: false positive; LC-aNAAT: low-complexity automated nucleic acid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.8523559570312,
        519.1832275390625,
        582.6072998046875
      ],
      "text": "amplification test; MRS: microbiological reference standard; TB: tuberculosis; TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.4710693359375,
        248.50355529785156,
        596.2418823242188
      ],
      "text": "a  Studies are sorted by decreasing sensitivity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.2338256835938,
        524.8345947265625,
        628.32177734375
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on synovial fluid be used to diagnose bone or joint TB in adults",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.6338500976562,
        505.99591064453125,
        642.7218017578125
      ],
      "text": "and adolescents with signs and symptoms of bone or joint TB, against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.388671875,
        526.6203002929688,
        666.53369140625
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT summary sensitivity and specificity were 96.6% (95% CI: 87.2–99.1) and 91.1%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.888671875,
        526.9634399414062,
        682.03369140625
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 80.8–96.2), respectively, from three Xpert Ultra studies (126 participants) ( );  Fig. 2.1.7",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997949600219727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.388671875,
        527.0194702148438,
        697.53369140625
      ],
      "text": "the certainty of evidence was low. Similar to other extrapulmonary TB sample types, the data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.888671875,
        526.9633178710938,
        713.03369140625
      ],
      "text": "using the CRS were also considered. The use of the CRS increased specificity of the LC-aNAAT",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.3887329101562,
        527.1668090820312,
        728.5337524414062
      ],
      "text": "on synovial fluid to 97.0% (95% CI: 85.0–100.0), whereas the impact on sensitivity was minimal",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974470138549805,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.8887329101562,
        526.9654541015625,
        744.0337524414062
      ],
      "text": "(96%) and largely involved tightening of the confidence interval (95% CI: 91–99%). Only data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.3887329101562,
        526.9260864257812,
        759.5337524414062
      ],
      "text": "on Xpert Ultra were included in the evaluation to answer this PICO question. Data on Truenat",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        761.8887329101562,
        135.01771545410156,
        775.0337524414062
      ],
      "text": "were limited.",
